---
const SWAP_URL = 'https://swap.ophis.fi/#/swap'
---
<div class="how-band">
  <section class="how" id="how" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal-up" data-reveal>How it works</p>
      <h2 class="serif reveal-up" id="howTitle" data-reveal>From choice <em>to confirmation.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede reveal-up" data-reveal>A short flow that keeps the amount, the route, and the approval in view at every step.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps reveal-up" data-reveal>
      <li>
        <span class="n">01</span>
        <h3>Choose amount and destination</h3>
        <p>Choose what to send and what to receive. For a cross-chain swap, add an address on the destination network.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n">02</span>
        <h3>Review route and limit</h3>
        <p>Check the estimated receive amount, fees, and spending limit together. Edit your trade before moving on.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n">03</span>
        <h3>Sign in your wallet</h3>
        <p>Review the approval request and confirm the swap in your wallet. Follow its progress through settlement.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="how-cta reveal-up" data-reveal>
      <a class="cta-primary" href={SWAP_URL}>Start a swap</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .how-band { background: var(--ophis-fog); border-top: 1px solid var(--ophis-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ophis-border); margin-top: 64px; }
  .how { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px; }
  .sec-head { max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .sec-head .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 44px); margin: 0; }
  .sec-head .lede { margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .steps { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .steps li { border-top: 1px solid var(--ophis-fg); padding-top: 16px; }
  .steps .n { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 22px; color: var(--ophis-fg-muted); }
  .steps h3 { margin: 8px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .steps p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ophis-fg-muted); }
  .how-cta { margin-top: 28px; }
  .cta-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 9999px; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; background: var(--ophis-saffron-60); color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .how { padding: 48px 16px; }
  }
</style>
